[en.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_RESEARCH]
Sciend and Magic

[en.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_RESEARCH_desc]
How would a perpetual motion machine celebrate its birthday?\n—— by proving scientists wrong.\n\nBut yeah, of course the scientists are wrong. This is a world of magic after all.

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_RESEARCH]
科学与魔法

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_INDUSTRY_RESEARCH_desc]
一个永动机会干什么来庆祝生日？\n—— 证明科学家们有错。\n\n当然，科学家们肯定是错的。毕竟这是一个魔法的世界。

